==English==

===Etymology 1===
Possibly an ellipsis of "Could you come again with what you just said?"

====Verb====
{{infl|en|verb|head=[[come]] [[again]]}}?

# {{idiomatic|informal}} Could you repeat that? What did you say? {{non-gloss definition|a polite formula used when one has not heard or understood what has been said}}

